OL,3,ADemocratic senator blames Egypt press
OL,4,Acrackdown on US military aid decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA top Democratic senator has blamed a
OL,7,Fcrackdown on independent journalism in
OL,8,FEgypt on a decision by the Trump
OL,9,Fadministration to waive human rights
OL,10,Fconditions on US military funding to
OL,11,Fthe country.
OL,13,FChris Murphy, who sits on the Senate
OL,14,FForeign Relations Committee, accused
OL,15,Fthe US government of "abandoning" the
OL,16,FEgyptian people after it lifted
OL,17,Frestrictions relating to more than
OL,18,F$300m of defence assistance.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
