OL,3,ADemocratic senator blames Egypt press
OL,4,Acrackdown on US military aid decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver the last month a series of arrests
OL,7,Fhas taken place of journalists at two
OL,8,Fof the few remaining independent news
OL,9,Foutlets in Egypt, where newspapers and
OL,10,FTV stations are closely controlled by
OL,11,Fthe authorities.
OL,13,FThe US State Department told the BBC it
OL,14,Fwaived conditions on a portion of
OL,15,Fmilitary aid to Egypt in September due
OL,16,Fto the country's "importance to US
OL,17,Fnational security interests".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
